  "verdict": {
    "part1": "Clean K=7 round-trip is already 1.0 at PSK init (zero headroom) and stays 1.0 after training: the \u03b3/\u03b8 PAC channel IS a functional code-carrier, but the constellation is analytically optimal at init, not learned. Under AWGN, training cannot beat untrained PSK (PSK is the max-min-distance optimum); the channel limit is the AWGN SNR ceiling, not the constellation.",
    "part2": "Isolated GTM-only channel (identity transducer) carries codes losslessly (1.000) in both the live MLP+LIF loop and the cross-substrate A->B sweep, trained and untrained alike. The ~1 percent full-protocol live number is entirely the UNTRAINED TRANSDUCER scrambling codes, not the channel. The protocol machinery is load-bearing AND functional: the channel does not cap information."
  }
